    "role": "user",
    "content": "Program: CBTRN02C. Input files and their record layouts:\n\nDALYTRAN: CVTRA06Y DALYTRAN-RECORD (350 bytes)\n  DALYTRAN-ID                  X(16)\n  DALYTRAN-TYPE-CD             X(2)\n  DALYTRAN-CAT-CD              9(4)\n  DALYTRAN-SOURCE              X(10)\n  DALYTRAN-DESC                X(100)\n  DALYTRAN-AMT                 S9(9)V9(2)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-ID         9(9)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-NAME       X(50)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-CITY       X(50)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-ZIP        X(10)\n  DALYTRAN-CARD-NUM            X(16)\n  DALYTRAN-ORIG-TS             X(26)\n  DALYTRAN-PROC-TS             X(26)\n\nXREF: CVACT03Y CARD-XREF-RECORD (50 bytes)\n  XREF-CARD-NUM                X(16)\n  XREF-CUST-ID                 9(9)\n  XREF-ACCT-ID                 9(11)\n\nACCOUNT: CVACT01Y ACCOUNT-RECORD (300 bytes)\n  ACCT-ID                      9(11)\n  ACCT-ACTIVE-STATUS           X(1)\n  ACCT-CURR-BAL                S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CREDIT-LIMIT            S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CASH-CREDIT-LIMIT       S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-OPEN-DATE               X(10)\n  ACCT-EXPIRAION-DATE          X(10)\n  ACCT-REISSUE-DATE            X(10)\n  ACCT-CURR-CYC-CREDIT         S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CURR-CYC-DEBIT          S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-ADDR-ZIP                X(10)\n  ACCT-GROUP-ID                X(10)\n\nTCATBAL: CVTRA01Y TRAN-CAT-BAL-RECORD (50 bytes)\n  TRANCAT-ACCT-ID              9(11)\n  TRANCAT-TYPE-CD              X(2)\n  TRANCAT-CD                   9(4)\n  TRAN-CAT-BAL                 S9(9)V9(2)\n\nRule to test:\n{\n \"id\": \"BR-CBTRN02C-001\",\n \"title\": \"Reject transaction whose card number is not in the card cross-reference file\",\n \"summary\": \"Each daily transaction's card number is looked up in the card cross-reference file. If the card isn't found, the transaction gets reason 100 'INVALID CARD NUMBER FOUND', the account lookup is skipped and the transaction goes to the reject file instead of being posted.\",\n \"given\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"Before each transaction is validated, the fail reason is set to 0 and the reason description is set to spaces.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON\",\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON-DESC\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"0\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The transaction's card number is used as the key for reading the card cross-reference file.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"DALYTRAN-CARD-NUM\",\n    \"FD-XREF-CARD-NUM\",\n    \"CARD-XREF-RECORD\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  }\n ],\n \"when\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"No cross-reference record exists for the card number (INVALID KEY on the read).\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"CARD-XREF-RECORD\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  }\n ],\n \"then\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The fail reason is set to 100.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"100\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The reason description is set to 'INVALID CARD NUMBER FOUND'.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON-DESC\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"INVALID CARD NUMBER FOUND\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The account lookup and the account checks are skipped because the fail reason is no longer 0.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"0\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The transaction is not posted. The reject count goes up by 1 and a reject record is written.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON\",\n    \"WS-REJECT-COUNT\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"0\",\n    \"1\"\n   ]\n  }\n ]\n}"
   }
